// Digital items for sale: the catalog. Each one gets a page at /shop/<id> (generated by scripts/build.js) and is synced
// into the store database (db/catalog.sql, same build), which is where checkout reads the price. Change a product
// here, run `node scripts/build.js` and commit; the deploy applies it. Paid files and preview clips are uploaded in
// the admin page (/admin), never committed.
// Fields:
//   id: lowercase-hyphenated, the page address and the product's permanent key. Never change it once published.
//   title, description (plain text), type: a key of data/product-types.js. price: number in SITE.currency (0 = free).
//   tags: optional list of short lowercase words. featured: shown on the home page.
//   image: optional artwork { src, width, height, alt }; without it the cover is generated from `hue` (green or purple).
//   release: optional id of the related release in data/music.js. includes: optional list of what's inside (plain text).
//   preview: optional { file, label }: an audio clip uploaded in the admin, played from /media/previews/<file>.
//     Never the paid file itself. metadata: optional facts shown on the product page ({ "Format": "WAV 24-bit" }).
//   project: id of the project that created it (data/projects.js); shown as "by <name>". Required.
//   pacs: optional list of Pac ids (data/pacs.js, same project) the product delivers; uploaded files are tagged with them.
//   draft: true = placeholder, not for sale. Still shown in the shop as "Coming soon", kept out of search and
//     unbuyable at checkout. Remove it once the product, price and files are real.
